1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:14,056
Writing, task one. Form number 6. You are looking for a new job. Answer the questions in the job agency questionnaire. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:14,767 --> 00:00:17,256
What job do you do now?

3
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:33,837
I currently work as a warehouse worker in a big company, loading and unloading goods.

4
00:00:34,733 --> 00:00:37,513
What job are you looking for and why?

5
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:55,487
I'm looking for an office job because I studied economics and want to work in my field.

6
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:59,273
When can you start work?

7
00:01:09,667 --> 00:01:16,057
I can start on the first of December because I have to hand in my notice.

8
00:01:16,967 --> 00:01:26,817
Fill in form 6 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
